Patch Notes - Version 1.0.8

Bug Fixes:

[list]
[*] Fixed the positioning of some interface elements that were not functioning correctly on ultra-wide monitors;
[*] Fixed a rare bug that caused the game to close unexpectedly when changing the game's resolution;
[*] Fixed the volume and sensitivity sliders in the pause menu that could not be adjusted with the controller;
[*] Minor fixes;
[/list]

Improvements:

[list]
[*] Usability improvements in the main menu;
[*] Usability improvements in the pause menu;
[*] General performance improvements;
[/list]


[i]No cats were harmed during the testing of this patch.[/i]


We thank everyone for their patience and support. We continue working to make Everloop the best possible experience for our community.

Sincerely,
Infinity Green Game Studio
